    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/df1935a98eff10b4abed58f29a61e7a7.avif?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9365ad2b33533bbf8e8d7246b76d8706.webp?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/d1ba1837df83597ca08fc501e985d4e6.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You opened your eyes, but nothing could be seen.<br>Suddenly, one string of dim light shone through the darkness.<br>As you followed the light of hope, it slowly turned from azure to crimson.<br>Once again, your consciousness faded away...<br><br>You opened your eyes, and found yourself in the middle of nowhere.<br>A mysterious girl, with her monotonous tone, spoke of various confusing matters.<br>Safe House. Purpose. Erosion. Death.<br>The only way to grasp the truth is to hold on the black sword of yours,<br>and fight against &quot;This World,&quot; no matter the consequences...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/48ba1a456cb294634b7e6a3b433861d0.webp?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/62b1a44d358d3ffa274aa212b5185d8f.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/62b1a44d358d3ffa274aa212b5185d8f.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/62b1a44d358d3ffa274aa212b5185d8f.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Step into the everchanging labyrinth</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Think carefully before you move in this turn-based battle system where enemies move right after you.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Be aware of the Erosion. You won't last long when it reaches its limit.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stay vigilant; you never know when you'll encounter the deadly traps.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9fa41b574da09a34b8bc63dec9602a56.webp?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/2a1067c836afc4d2ab6905afc7d7cee0.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More than 100 weapons to forge right where you stand</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Create different weapons based on the materials you choose.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each and every weapon possesses an unique Skill, broaden your playstyle.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make shattered weapons materials as well, inheriting their strength to the next masterpiece.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/a6cc92e59ecbe8a970bc917e726d117b.webp?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/9e5c2cd11ad45c528afc50f625ce187b.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overcome death and become stronger with your souls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect Souls for permanent upgrades and items.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Stride ahead against a variety of elite enemies.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Test your might and knowledge in challenging boss battles.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/6c583a4757e27599915f3a1e1d4ed659.webp?t=1752566179\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/e21bf68c123408d97d5c774993710c2c.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All 6 main characters and elite enemies are fully voiced by Japanese voice actresses, with real-time 2D animations.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find Memories to reach out to the truth of &quot;this world.&quot;</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Supports Steam Deck and controllers, with modifyable key configurations.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.poster.avif?t=1752566179\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.webm?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1414910/extras/17067022f6c7d9b19c2ac77276e21de5.mp4?t=1752566179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;I will stay with you right here. Try all you can, through hell and fire's end...&quot;</strong></h2>",
